  "description": {
    "text": "The 2015 Pokémon World Championships, held from 21 to 23 August 2015 at the Hynes Convention Center in Boston. Competitors got Champions Festival in seven languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nTrophy cards, No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer, went to the top four of each age division in both the card game and the video game championships.",
